<title>USA: NHL ICE HOCKEY-SATURDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NHL ICE HOCKEY-SATURDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round National Hockey League Stanley Cup playoff games on Saturday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	     Eastern Conference</p>
<p> NEW JERSEY	   4    Montreal	1</p>
<p>(New Jersey leads best-of-seven series 2-0)</p>
<p> Ottawa		 3    BUFFALO	 1</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied 1-1)</p>
<p> PHILADELPHIA	 3    Pittsburgh    2</p>
<p>(Philadelphia leads best-of-seven series 2-0)</p>
